# A plugin adding a function to the expression language.
#
# Registering one used to declare two overloads CEL considers the same shape —
# a variadic taking list(dyn) and a single-argument one taking dyn, which
# matches a list — so building the expression environment failed outright and
# every transform in the flow went down with it, whether or not anything
# referred to the plugin. Nothing in this suite used a functions block, so it
# went unnoticed.
functions "custom" {
  wasm    = "/etc/mycel/plugins/test-plugin/functions.wasm"
  exports = ["shout"]
}
